        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka Yohana betimo tic maka pare, ewacu kumae, Iwu wacu nyo an a ng’a? An a en ungo. Ento nen, ng’atu acel ubebino i ng’eya ma wara pare gonjre ira ngo kum aromo ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
